    75	- Prose in comments and docs: ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English. Tables: Unicode box drawing in fenced `text` blocks.
    76	- Namespaces: `AvailableChain.SimplexFG` (LM) and `AvailableChain.KitFG` (L5).
    77	- LM files hold definitions and `decide` examples only. Theorems with proofs go in `AvailableChainKitFG`.
    78	- A docstring starts with its pin and clause, ``[pin fj.twoChanges.core.v1] (item 3 (i))``, or with ``[helper]``.
