   922	"acceptance only", alfs4 lines 996–1002): the band start is `h_max − 1`, also in
   923	a contest. -/
   924	def acceptViable (st : Store V) : Finset (FGBlock V) :=
   925	  st.TF.filter (fun B => FGBlock.preceq st.F B &&
   926	    decide (∃ W ∈ st.TF, FGBlock.Preceq B W ∧ st.h_max - 1 ≤ hOf E cfg W))
