  1177	  - `storeInv_on_block`:
  1178	    - Split on the branch of `on_block`. Refused (`B ∈ TF`, or `B.parent ∉ TF`, or `F ⋠ B`, or `B.slot ≤ B.parent.slot`): the store does not change, so the invariant is the old one, and no `ViewRootInj` is used. Accepted: `B ∉ TF`, `B.parent ∈ TF` and `F ⪯ B`; `hinj` gives `ViewRootInj (insert B st.TF)` for `pair`.
